Subject: [PATCH 088/102] Edit Pinned Page: replace the pinned address with the
 current one, or type it
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Arc's right-click > Edit Pinned Page > Replace Pinned URL with Current, and
Edit… (the address in place of the title, typed).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
